 or (yres and yres ~= meta.resşy) then _G.aegisub.debug.out(2, "Warning: script resolution %dx%d does not match with loaded video resolution %dx%d resample script resolution", meta.resşx, meta.resşy, xres, yres) endComment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,code syl,function phong(ref) ci[ref]=ci[ref]+1; return "" end; ci=; cn= _G.unicode.len(orgline.textşstripped:gsub(" ","")); huong=Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,template notext,!retime("line",-300,0)!!phong(4)!m 10 0 l 10 20 b 6 20 2 21 2 25 b 2 29 11 29 11 21 l 11 7 b 14 8 18 12 15 19 b 21 11 12 6 10 0Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,template notext,!retime("line",-300,0)!!phong(3)!m 10 0 l 10 20 b 6 20 2 21 2 25 b 2 29 11 29 11 21 l 11 7 b 14 8 18 12 15 19 b 21 11 12 6 10 0Comment: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:07.00,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,template char,!retime("line",(ci[1]-1)*10,-300+(ci[1]-1)*10)!!phong(1)!Comment: 0,0:30:10.24,0:30:14.75,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Come on, let's sing together!Comment: 0,0:30:14.75,0:30:19.42,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Little Sea Slugs!Comment: 0,0:30:19.42,0:30:24.09,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,When you stop working...Comment: 0,0:30:24.09,0:30:28.64,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,you'll be much happier!Comment: 0,0:30:28.64,0:30:30.76,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Security? I forbid it!Comment: 0,0:30:30.76,0:30:33.18,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Reporting? I forbid it!Comment: 0,0:30:33.18,0:30:36.31,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,But singing is...Comment: 0,0:30:36.31,0:30:38.55,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,okay!Comment: 0,0:30:45.84,0:30:50.08,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Yes, you shouldn't be working!Comment: 0,0:30:54.99,0:31:02.13,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,That's the rule... for a day off!﻿[Script Info]; Script generated by Aegisub 3.2.2; http://www.aegisub.org/Title: HorribleSubsScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0PlayResX: 1280PlayResY: 720ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: TV.601Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.28,0:01:44.43,Title,,0,0,250,,MeriendaDialogue: 0,0:01:59.06,0:02:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Pâtissiers!Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.06,0:02:00.00,Note,,0,0,0,,Pastry ChefsDialogue: 0,0:02:00.00,0:02:01.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.14,0:02:03.84,Main,,0,0,0,,We're on our way!Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.05,0:02:13.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Katakuri-sama! That was an incredible victory!Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.14,0:02:16.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course, your win was inevitable from the beginning!Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.66,0:02:20.32,Main,,0,0,0,,But we were concerned whether you could eat today's snack!Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.53,0:02:25.40,Main,,0,0,0,,We were all ready and waiting at three o'clock!Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.78,0:02:32.60,Main,,0,0,0,,We know that you're a perfectionist who wants to...Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.60,0:02:36.37,Main,,0,0,0,,have your merienda at a fixed time every day so we understand how you must feel!Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.37,0:02:39.01,Main,,0,0,0,,The thing is, your tea...Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.71,0:02:43.29,Main,,0,0,0,,got cold since it's been 40 minutes...Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.53,0:02:46.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Iced tea is fine.Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.34,0:02:49.67,Main,,0,0,0,,He's so generous!Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.67,0:02:52.88,Main,,0,0,0,,In any case, we are very proud of today's sweets!Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.88,0:02:56.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Here is today's merienda!Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.43,0:02:58.97,Main,,0,0,0,,For the perfect Katakuri-sama...Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.97,0:03:02.89,Main,,0,0,0,,We made it from the perfect ingredients!Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.41,0:03:07.21,Main,,0,0,0,,By using an abundance of the finest Corioli cacao we could find on the black market...Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.21,0:03:09.40,Main,,0,0,0,,and rich cow milk...Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.40,0:03:11.04,Main,,0,0,0,,with a cortisol level below nine...Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.04,0:03:15.22,Main,,0,0,0,,that was pasteurized on a Sky Island...Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.22,0:03:17.57,Main,,0,0,0,,we were able to create sweet chocolate donuts!Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.91,0:03:18.97,Main,,0,0,0,,And for this one...Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.97,0:03:22.59,Main,,0,0,0,,we whipped high-grade cream that was given to us by Opera-sama...Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.59,0:03:24.83,Main,,0,0,0,,the Minister of Cream, a few days ago.Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.85,0:03:31.19,Main,,0,0,0,,I used a lot of Haki while fighting Straw Hat.Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.63,0:03:36.24,Main,,0,0,0,,In order for me to take care of his fleeing crew...Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.81,0:03:39.53,Main,,0,0,0,,I need to restore my energy.Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.33,0:03:43.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Sugar is a source of power!Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.97,0:03:50.37,Main,,0,0,0,,I will consume it.Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.37,0:04:31.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go into the shrine.Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.72,0:04:32.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.56,0:04:35.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Do not let anyone in.Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.49,0:04:40.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course we won't! You will not be disturbed! Take all the time you need!Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.57,0:05:13.08,Main,,0,0,0,,He's so vigilant...Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.39,0:05:20.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Nobody has witnessed Katakuri-sama eating...Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.44,0:05:25.37,Main,,0,0,0,,What a prudent man. When eating, people usually let their guards down.Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.37,0:05:29.03,Main,,0,0,0,,But even during teatime, a time where people relax with others...Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.03,0:05:35.37,Main,,0,0,0,,he stoically concentrates his mind and supplies his body with nutrition all on his own.Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.32,0:05:42.17,Main,,0,0,0,,As expected of the warrior with a bounty of over one billion, and the foundation of the Big Mom Pirates...Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.17,0:05:47.82,Main,,0,0,0,,He's in a totally different class when compared to the captain of that little pirate crew...Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.82,0:05:48.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.17,0:05:50.22,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.61,0:05:52.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Wasn't it there?Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.44,0:05:53.22,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.22,0:05:55.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat's hand...Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.48,0:05:59.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.97,0:06:01.19,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.99,0:06:03.42,Main,,0,0,0,,The mochi is moving!Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.42,0:06:04.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'm blind?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.71,0:06:05.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Why is it moving?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.72,0:06:07.12,Main,,0,0,0,,How would I know?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.62,0:06:16.08,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.69,0:06:18.09,Main,,0,0,0,,He wasn't dead?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.09,0:06:19.95,Main,,0,0,0,,How did he get out from under all that mochi?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.95,0:06:22.05,Main,,0,0,0,,I ate the mochi!Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.05,0:06:23.02,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.02,0:06:27.96,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell's with the way the pirates fight here?! Do I just have to keep eating to win?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.96,0:06:30.73,Main,,0,0,0,,You're the only one who can eat that much!Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.88,0:06:35.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Where'd that guy go?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.01,0:06:38.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Katakuri-sama isn't here now!Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.51,0:06:41.34,Main,,0,0,0,,He left the Mirro-world earlier!Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.34,0:06:45.18,Main,,0,0,0,,He had important business! Now, shall we leave, too?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.18,0:06:46.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.66,0:06:51.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I can sense the voice of something strong in there.Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.56,0:06:54.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Observation Haki?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.03,0:06:55.69,Main,,0,0,0,,So he's eating donuts?Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.69,0:06:56.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Sniff, sniff.Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.37,0:06:58.82,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Observation Haki?Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.82,0:07:00.86,Main,,0,0,0,,No, he just has a good nose...Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.78,0:07:05.07,Main,,0,0,0,,That bastard! He's kicking back just because he thinks he won?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.07,0:07:09.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid! A fool like you is incapable of comprehending Katakuri-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.83,0:07:16.09,Main,,0,0,0,,He is currently conversing with the god of war inside the temple!Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.09,0:07:20.76,Main,,0,0,0,,It is a sacred time. No one is allowed... to interrupt...Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.24,0:07:33.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the...?Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.69,0:07:35.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you going?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.86,0:07:52.57,Main,,0,0,0,,In the end, that idiot got scared!Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.57,0:07:55.73,Main,,0,0,0,,It's exactly what I expected from the captain of a weak pirate crew!Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.73,0:07:58.14,Main,,0,0,0,,He's only good at running away!Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.21,0:08:04.59,Main,,0,0,0,,He's coming back?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.59,0:08:05.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Why?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.34,0:08:08.35,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm skinny again!Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.35,0:08:11.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?! Is the human body supposed to work like that?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.82,0:08:16.24,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! I'm prepared now! Here I go!Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.24,0:08:17.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it!Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.11,0:08:19.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Go away, go away!Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.70,0:08:22.03,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't go near there!Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.16,0:08:26.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.96,0:08:32.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Elephant Gun!Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.14,0:08:41.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Katakuri-sama! We are so very sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.07,0:08:48.44,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Ahh, donuts!Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.44,0:08:51.67,Thoughts,,0,0,0,, Yummy... donuts!Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.67,0:08:54.78,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Yummy to the core, donuts!Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.78,0:08:59.26,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,While alone, I eat donuts! Lying on my back, I eat donuts!Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.92,0:09:03.68,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,A forbidden pleasure, a sense of guilt and...Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.68,0:09:05.74,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Donuts!Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.74,0:09:08.30,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,This is a blissful time.Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.30,0:09:12.65,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Donuts, donuts... Oh, donuts!Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.65,0:09:15.27,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,So delicious, donuts!Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.28,0:09:38.56,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Big Brother Katakuri is a superhuman!Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.56,0:09:42.17,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,He's never laid down in his life!Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.17,0:09:44.98,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,He's a man who scorns even the ground!Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.98,0:09:47.11,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,He's always dignified...Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.11,0:09:49.57,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,calm, and strong!Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.57,0:09:51.87,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,He's the perfect human!Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.48,0:09:57.91,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,That's our big brother, Katakuri!Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.01,0:10:10.11,Main,,0,0,0,,You saw me eating!Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.29,0:10:14.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Our fight hasn't ended yet!Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.66,0:10:32.51,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.69,0:10:46.15,Main,,0,0,0,,H-Have mercy!Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.01,0:10:50.21,Main,,0,0,0,,We didn't see it! We didn't see anything!Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.21,0:10:54.61,Main,,0,0,0,,We won't tell anyone! Even if our mouths are ripped apart!Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.61,0:10:57.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Whose mouth did you say was ripped?Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.06,0:10:59.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Square Mochi!Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.19,0:11:01.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Nooo!!Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.44,0:11:13.72,Main,,0,0,0,,So you're still alive! That's my mistake for not seeing your death through to the end!Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.55,0:11:16.73,Main,,0,0,0,,I was at the limit of my patience!Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.40,0:11:33.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch!Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.54,0:11:38.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I've got the upper hand in Armament Haki, too!Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.90,0:11:42.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Do not think that you can stand up to me!Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.22,0:11:45.17,Main,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a worm to me!Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.22,0:12:24.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I cannot allow anyone who has seen my true form...Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.30,0:12:27.43,Main,,0,0,0,,to live!Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.02,0:12:30.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn!Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.29,0:12:52.04,Main,,0,0,0,,He didn't dodge it... and my kick landed!Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.86,0:12:54.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Why's that?Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.92,0:12:59.34,Main,,0,0,0,,So what if I got kicked?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.55,0:13:07.22,Main,,0,0,0,,I was able to ward it off easily!Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.99,0:13:13.77,Main,,0,0,0,,He didn't attack again right away!Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.85,0:13:43.20,Main,,0,0,0,,I get it now...Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.30,0:13:46.01,Main,,0,0,0,,your ability.Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.01,0:13:48.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? What did you get?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.86,0:13:53.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I've told you several times already! Your ability can't win against mine!Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.82,0:13:58.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Here I come!Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.04,0:14:07.20,Main,,0,0,0,,This time, I'll make sure you die!Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.01,0:14:15.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Gear Fourth!Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.18,0:14:21.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Rainfall Mochi!Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.29,0:14:40.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Boundman!Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.14,0:14:45.59,Main,,0,0,0,,You're strong but you're not invincible!Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.08,0:14:49.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Screw you!!Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.67,0:15:10.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Get crushed!Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.86,0:15:27.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.78,0:15:33.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Kong Gun!Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.20,0:16:01.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought you were invincible!Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.81,0:16:10.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Because Armament Haki is a power that makes things tangible...Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.82,0:16:17.07,Main,,0,0,0,,And because it's a power that works even on Logias...Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.79,0:16:29.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought it was weird that my attacks passed right through your body!Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.29,0:16:35.34,Main,,0,0,0,,But I was wrong!Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.65,0:16:38.30,Main,,0,0,0,,You can get...Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.66,0:16:41.38,Main,,0,0,0,,hit, too!Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.18,0:17:02.82,Main,,0,0,0,,And even against your extremely hard Armament defense...Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.88,0:17:11.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Gear Fourth... won't lose!Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.08,0:17:17.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.71,0:17:21.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Culverin!Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.63,0:17:29.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Your mochi ability isn't what's amazing!Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.17,0:17:33.64,Main,,0,0,0,,It's your Observation Haki, isn't it?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.02,0:18:11.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.01,0:18:14.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Rhino Schneider!Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.51,0:18:39.91,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Big Brother Katakuri...Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.29,0:18:45.92,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,is a superhuman whose back has never once touched the ground since he was born!Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.59,0:18:58.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.77,0:19:02.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Kong Organ!Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.40,0:19:14.20,Main,,0,0,0,,You figured it out...Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.36,0:19:16.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed.Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.79,0:19:24.36,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right. I just transform to dodge your attacks efficiently.Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.48,0:19:28.18,Main,,0,0,0,,It's all possible because of my ability to see the future with Haki.Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.65,0:19:32.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Because I was a little flustered...Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.35,0:19:38.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I gave you the chance to land an attack on me.Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.00,0:19:43.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Observation Haki can't be utilized if you're not calm.Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.00,0:19:49.77,Main,,0,0,0,,How many years has it been since I last got punched?Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.11,0:20:03.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm beginning to realize how my younger brother Cracker...Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.89,0:20:08.21,Main,,0,0,0,,was defeated by you.Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.81,0:20:10.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that the biscuit guy?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.24,0:20:13.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Peerless Donuts!Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.45,0:20:33.00,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not mochi this time?! Screw you!Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.00,0:20:33.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Rhino...Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.11,0:20:54.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Power Mochi!Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.22,0:21:36.51,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't show you vulnerability a second time...Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.99,0:21:39.35,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess we're back to square one again.Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.60,0:21:43.10,Captions,,0,30,155,,Cacao IslandDialogue: 0,0:21:43.41,0:21:47.65,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you! Please open the door!Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.70,0:21:53.45,Captions,,0,1015,320,,Sweets FactoryDialogue: 0,0:21:53.45,0:21:58.13,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't do that, Pound-san! Please give up and step back.Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.13,0:22:00.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Why not?Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.39,0:22:02.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-sama was very clear on this.Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.63,0:22:06.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I just want to get a glimpse of Chiffon!Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.93,0:22:08.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Who is that?Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.71,0:22:11.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I think he was Mama's 25th husband.Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.44,0:22:12.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah...Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.55,0:22:28.75,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I knew it was her right away!Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.44,0:22:39.50,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Chiffon hasn't changed at all since the day she was born!Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.50,0:22:47.27,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,She's as cute as she's always been!Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.27,0:22:52.58,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I just want to meet her and exchange just a few words!Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.31,0:22:59.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.36,0:23:04.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't it a little noisy out there?Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.06,0:23:11.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Some guy is yelling, huh? But no worries. No one can come in here!Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.67,0:23:12.99,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Pudding?Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.51,0:23:16.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Nothing. Sister Brûlée, I'm listening.Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.27,0:23:20.21,Main,,0,0,0,,So, at 1 AM tonight,Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.21,0:23:27.09,Main,,0,0,0,,the Straw Hats' ship, which we lost track of, will show up at Cacao Island! Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.09,0:23:30.07,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Here?! At 1 AM?Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.60,0:23:38.19,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,The plan was to meet up with Nami-san and the others at sea...Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.19,0:23:39.73,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,and hand over the wedding cake...Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.69,0:23:46.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Why is the Straw Hats' ship coming to Cacao Island?Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.36,0:23:55.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Because that is the place where they'll rendezvous with their separated captain, Straw Hat Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.24,0:24:05.54,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I see... But this isn't good. Big Mom and her children know our plan.Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.54,0:24:07.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Although...Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.53,0:24:14.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy will never make it to Cacao Island!Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.45,0:24:16.93,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.93,0:24:23.52,Main,,0,0,0,,He pushed his luck and challenged Big Brother Katakuri to a one-on-one duel!Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.60,0:24:39.49,Main,,0,0,0,,So he'll definitely be defeated... it serves him right!Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.54,0:24:45.52,Main,,0,0,0,,One, two!Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.91,0:24:50.45,Main,,0,0,0,,It's 4 PM now, isn't it?Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.51,0:24:54.23,Main,,0,0,0,,That means, in nine hours,Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.23,0:24:59.72,Main,,0,0,0,,the Straw Hat crew will arrive at Cacao Island and wait for their captain, who'll never appear.Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.83,0:25:07.19,Main,,0,0,0,,And Mama, with her Hunger Pangs, will lead herself and Brother Peros back to Cacao Island!Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.19,0:25:10.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone will be gathered together!Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.46,0:25:14.49,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't afford to fail in that situation!Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.49,0:25:17.22,Main,,0,0,0,,You take care of Mama, Pudding!Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.26,0:25:20.50,Main,,0,0,0,,You're our only hope!Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.50,0:25:22.98,Main,,0,0,0,,You can count on me, Sister Brûlée!Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.98,0:25:27.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll stop Mama with the greatest wedding cake ever!Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.78,0:25:31.76,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to it.Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.42,0:25:33.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way,Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.51,0:25:38.51,Main,,0,0,0,,even if the Straw Hats arrive there sooner, don't worry.Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.65,0:25:43.93,Main,,0,0,0,,You can leave them to Big Bro Oven's troops who just got there!Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.93,0:25:47.85,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Big Bro Oven's here?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.86,0:25:55.07,Main,,0,0,0,,It's Oven-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.07,0:25:56.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Oven-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.36,0:26:02.37,Captions,,0,0,230,,Charlotte Oven - 4th Son of the Charlotte Family Minister of Browned FoodDialogue: 0,0:25:56.46,0:25:59.66,Main,,0,0,1,,What do you mean I can't enter the factory?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.66,0:26:03.13,Main,,0,0,1,,Those were Pudding-sama's orders...Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.13,0:26:04.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Not even me?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.34,0:26:05.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Correct, no one.Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.77,0:26:09.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, if that's what my little sister wants, I'll accept it.Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.00,0:26:13.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Also, why is it so noisy in front of the factory?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.07,0:26:15.67,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Oh, that's because...Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.36,0:26:19.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Chiffon!Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.06,0:26:21.52,Main,,0,0,0,,That guy's...Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.98,0:26:34.53,Main,,0,0,0,,S-Stop hurting me!Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.53,0:26:36.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up, suspicious man!Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.65,0:26:40.70,Main,,0,0,0,,D-Don't you remember me, Oven-kun?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.24,0:26:45.65,Main,,0,0,0,,I remember you, my former stepfather.Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.65,0:26:51.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I'm happy that you remember me.Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.06,0:26:55.55,Main,,0,0,0,,I used to be your stepfather.Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.40,0:27:01.43,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I must remove you.Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.43,0:27:02.55,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.70,0:27:07.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder who's making that racket outside...Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.70,0:27:09.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it bothering you?Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.17,0:27:11.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-san! Were you listening?Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.71,0:27:12.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.61,0:27:14.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-kun is in trouble!Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.51,0:27:15.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Right.Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.59,0:27:18.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he's fighting one-on-one with Brother Katakuri.Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.83,0:27:21.32,Main,,0,0,0,,That's too reckless!Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.32,0:27:22.22,Main,,0,0,0,,I bet so.Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.22,0:27:26.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Brother Katakuri is a superhuman! His bounty is over one billion!Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.65,0:27:30.66,Main,,0,0,0,,He's never been defeated! What should we do?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.67,0:27:33.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Then today...Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.01,0:27:37.27,Main,,0,0,0,,he'll lose for the first time.Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.20,0:27:40.84,Main,,0,0,0,,What we've got to do now is...Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.84,0:27:43.77,Main,,0,0,0,,...make the greatest cake ever, right?Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.66,0:27:51.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Your stupid friend...Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.18,0:27:55.87,Main,,0,0,0,,will be completely destroyed at the hands of Brother Katakuri!Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.35,0:27:57.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.85,0:27:59.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-chan.Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.66,0:28:04.05,Main,,0,0,0,,It's okay. Let's make the cake.Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.65,0:28:08.50,Main,,0,0,0,,This is our first joint project, isn't it?Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.53,0:28:14.22,Main,,0,0,0,,...san!Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.22,0:28:17.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Pudding-sama is steaming!Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.05,0:28:18.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Did someone bake her?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.38,0:28:19.26,Main,,0,0,0,,No way!Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.70,0:28:24.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.66,0:28:30.04,Captions,,0,0,235,,At Sea - The SunnyDialogue: 0,0:28:30.04,0:28:32.38,Main,,0,0,0,,No one's coming after us!Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.38,0:28:38.01,Main,,0,0,0,,This is odd. In this region of the sea... there's no way pursuers won't come!Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.01,0:28:39.80,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you think is happening?Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.80,0:28:41.68,Main,,0,0,0,,It has to be a trap!Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.68,0:28:46.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry! We won't let our guards down for even a single moment!Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.22,0:28:50.74,Main,,0,0,0,,By the way, I wonder if Aladine and the others are okay...Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.39,0:28:54.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I hope they got away safely...Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.38,0:28:56.25,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.25,0:29:01.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama is destroying Nuts Island?! What do you mean by that, Big Bro Peros?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.46,0:29:03.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I mean...!Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.13,0:29:06.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Mont d'Or-sama! We have a problem!Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.14,0:29:10.27,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it this time?! We already have enough problems!Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.71,0:29:14.64,Main,,0,0,0,,By looking into the sea... we found out a terrible truth...Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.39,0:29:18.69,Main,,0,0,0,,The thing is...Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.69,0:29:21.15,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.69,0:29:21.15,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Cock-a?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.15,0:29:25.07,Main,,0,0,0,,All the Territorial Sea Slugs are gone?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.07,0:29:26.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Why?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.69,0:29:28.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Are they all dead-jour?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.57,0:29:30.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Not a single one left?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.87,0:29:31.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know...Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.95,0:29:36.93,Main,,0,0,0,,There were tens of thousands of them! How could they be gone all of a sudden?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.79,0:29:39.51,Main,,0,0,0,,M-Maybe they were kidnapped?Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.51,0:29:41.32,Main,,0,0,0,,By who, you idiot?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.32,0:29:44.68,Main,,0,0,0,,In that case, the enemy ships can go wherever they like!Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.68,0:29:46.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Do something!Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.89,0:29:48.91,Main,,0,0,0,,L-Like what...?Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.91,0:29:52.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Find out why they're gone! Hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.86,0:29:54.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.94,0:30:14.75,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,fx,m 10 0 l 10 20 b 6 20 2 21 2 25 b 2 29 11 29 11 21 l 11 7 b 14 8 18 12 15 19 b 21 11 12 6 10 0Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.94,0:30:14.75,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,fx,m 10 0 l 10 20 b 6 20 2 21 2 25 b 2 29 11 29 11 21 l 11 7 b 14 8 18 12 15 19 b 21 11 12 6 10 0Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.94,0:30:14.75,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,fx,m 10 0 l 10 20 b 6 20 2 21 2 25 b 2 29 11 29 11 21 l 11 7 b 14 8 18 12 15 19 b 21 11 12 6 10 0Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.94,0:30:14.75,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,fx,m 10 0 l 10 20 b 6 20 2 21 2 25 b 2 29 11 29 11 21 l 11 7 b 14 8 18 12 15 19 b 21 11 12 6 10 0Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.23,0:30:14.44,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,fx,CDialogue: 0,0:30:10.24,0:30:14.45,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 0,0:30:10.25,0:30:14.46,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,fx,mDialogue: 0,0:30:10.26,0:30:14.47,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 0,0:30:10.27,0:30:14.48,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.28,0:30:14.49,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 0,0:30:10.29,0:30:14.50,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 0,0:30:10.30,0:30:14.51,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,fx,,Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.31,0:30:14.52,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.32,0:30:14.53,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,fx,lDialogue: 0,0:30:10.33,0:30:14.54,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 0,0:30:10.34,0:30:14.55,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,fx,tDialogue: 0,0:30:10.35,0:30:14.56,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,fx,'Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.36,0:30:14.57,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 0,0:30:10.37,0:30:14.58,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.38,0:30:14.59,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 0,0:30:10.39,0:30:14.60,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 0,0:30:10.40,0:30:14.61,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 0,0:30:10.41,0:30:14.62,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,fx,gDialogue: 0,0:30:10.42,0: